FENÔMENO CELESTIAL
EM BRIGHTBURN - KANSAS

350
00:32:59,036 --> 00:33:00,465
Brandon!

351
00:33:03,572 --> 00:33:05,212
Meu Deus.

352
00:33:15,773 --> 00:33:17,073
Tome...

353
00:33:18,359 --> 00:33:19,759
Tome...

354
